          "context_sha256": "84ae8185b6d5087f55ceab82f8dca26f9616b1341214f6c69f78ca24a6e42386",
          "excerpt": "Replace a fragile prompt that asks an LLM to \"return JSON\" with a call that returns typed values by construction.",
          "sha256": "72b81af8a34379d9c6d0f632aabc6b69b98dad6a85371ffd088687e844841a80",
          "source_id": "docs:introduction/coding-agents",
          "url": "https://docs.typesafe.ai/introduction/coding-agents.md"
        },
        {
          "context_sha256": "84ae8185b6d5087f55ceab82f8dca26f9616b1341214f6c69f78ca24a6e42386",
          "excerpt": "If any of that matches what you're building, the fastest path in is the Quick start, then the primitives reference for the question types.",
          "sha256": "72b81af8a34379d9c6d0f632aabc6b69b98dad6a85371ffd088687e844841a80",
          "source_id": "docs:introduction/coding-agents",
          "url": "https://docs.typesafe.ai/introduction/coding-agents.md"
        }
      ],
      "id": "prefer-typed-decisions-over-prompt-parsing",
      "interpretation": "Repository interpretation supported by literal claims and manually reviewed complete source contexts; not an upstream quote.",
      "last_changed": "2026-10-23",
      "last_verified": "2026-10-18",
      "sources": [],
      "status": "unknown",
      "summary": "For decisions expressible as TypeSafe's typed questions, consider replacing fragile generative return-JSON prompts with typed decision calls. This guidance does not cover arbitrary text generation or every JSON task."
    },
    {
      "category": "decision-boundary",
      "evidence_reviews": [
        {
          "context_sha256": "4276ad8e3253d945edfb74eaebd8237892829aeafe0d1ec34ebc6645b57ff0ed",
